{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40888","headline":"冬暮野寺 · 任翻","name":"冬暮野寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江东寒近腊，野寺水天昏。\n无酒可销夜，随僧早闭门。\n照墙灯影短，着瓦雪声繁。\n飘泊仍千里，清吟欲断魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任翻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}